{
  "id": "ai4sgExtract0001",
  "name": "AI4SG · C Extract & Interpretation",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## C · Extract & Interpretation (runs the Extraction Skill)\nCalled once per new source. Fetches the full text (PDF or web page), then two AI steps:\n**1 · Relevance Screen (GPT-6 Luna, cheap):** applies the Search Skill's definition of AI for Social Good. Sources that are not AI4SG, or below the threshold chosen on the run page (*Relevance screen*), are saved as *filtered out* and never reach the experts.\n**2 · Extract & Interpret (GPT-6 Sol):** only for sources that pass. Follows the Extraction Skill and the experts' worked examples; every field cites the source (original + English); **Verify Evidence** checks each quote occurs in the text. Saved as *pending review* for the audit page.",
        "width": 3000,
        "height": 170
      },
      "id": "4f1b95ec-5e2c-59ae-94ab-f52b5b9cac33",
      "name": "Note · title",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧑‍🔬 Skills in\n`skills/search/SKILL.md`: definition of AI4SG, used by the relevance screen.\n\n`skills/extraction/SKILL.md`: field definitions and interpretation rules (the experts' focus and priors, e.g. cost and benefit).\n\n`skills/extraction/examples/*.md`: extractions the experts made by hand, used as worked examples in the prompt.",
        "width": 500,
        "height": 440,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "98d29447-9ee9-5ea9-aadc-e691e4ffaefb",
